{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/anantara-residences-seven-tides-palm-jumeirah","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":420,"crm_id":"1723","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Anantara Residences","slug":"anantara-residences-seven-tides-palm-jumeirah","display_address":"Palm Jumeirah","building_type":["penthouse","apartment","villa"],"completion_year":"2014","developer":"Seven Tides","price":44500888,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.129988,"longitude":55.1457949,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":"0","about":"<p>Anantara Residences is a premium residential development by Seven Tides. The development is located on the popular Palm Jumeirah Island, on the eastern side of the island, overlooking the famous Burj Al Arab Hotel. For sale are <strong>studios and spacious apartments with 1, 2 bedrooms, as well as luxury penthouses and villas</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>The residences have high quality finishes, marble floors, kitchens are equipped with furniture and appliances SMEG. In the interior, soft neutral palettes combined with natural light create a space that is livable, calm and luxurious. The panoramic windows offer stunning views of the Persian Gulf.</p><p>World-class amenities are provided for residents: gym, tennis courts, temperature-controlled swimming pools with recreation area, children's playgrounds, SPA zone, restaurants. There is also a private beach, which provides a real luxury resort lifestyle.</p><p>Palm Jumeirah Island has a developed infrastructure, where a lot of entertainment, beaches and parks. Gyms, restaurants, medical centers and business centers are just minutes away. Residents of Anantara Residences can easily access any part of Dubai via Palm Jumeirah Road. It links the island to the city and intersects with Sheikh Zayed Road, a major thoroughfare. The Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are just a 25-minute drive away. Dubai International Airport is approximately 40 minutes away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1723/images/2024/04/24/46MQYkb5MSbDLtqlLYuqWFSdfS6Uo2k7U4XKNLzP.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/46MQYkb5MSbDLtqlLYuqWFSdfS6Uo2k7U4XKNLzP.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1723/images/2024/04/24/w7P7z1snAXf24o9N1fUZf01OAVbvA2gGzFfXrMoA.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/w7P7z1snAXf24o9N1fUZf01OAVbvA2gGzFfXrMoA.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1723/images/2024/04/24/Sd3e76EfZb6ZQ5lr15htxTljlmoWSDSSpNk95dZO.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/04/24/Sd3e76EfZb6ZQ5lr15htxTljlmoWSDSSpNk95dZO.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2948,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/04/24/i7Zir9ESqmH6voQRJqzV54ezGshSXOV6jQqequsD.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1353,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[{"id":6719,"title":"100%","description":"On Booking"}],"community":"Palm Jumeirah","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":11695,"url":null,"text":"Shared Pool","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11696,"url":null,"text":"Shared SPA","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11697,"url":null,"text":"Kids Play Area","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11698,"url":null,"text":"Shared gym & fitness","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11699,"url":null,"text":"Leisure areas","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11700,"url":null,"text":"Dining outlets  (coffee houses & restaurants)","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11701,"url":null,"text":"Tennis court","type":null,"image":null},{"id":11702,"url":null,"text":"Social zone","type":n